<title>NEW ZEALAND: CRICKET-SRI LANKA 37-0 AFTER FOLLOWING ON.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-SRI LANKA 37-0 AFTER FOLLOWING ON.</headline>
<dateline>DUNEDIN, New Zealand 1997-03-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sri Lanka were 37 without loss after following on 364 behind at the close of the third day of the first cricket test on Sunday.</p>
<p>Scores: New Zealand 586 for seven declared (B.Young 267 not out). Sri Lanka 222 (S.Doull 5-58) and 37 for no wicket.</p>
</text>
